# What ../../install.sh copies when someone installs this plugin without the plugin system.
# Verbs are documented in ../adversarial-review/install.manifest.
#
# This plugin is a mod: a hooks module that draws a band above the prompt. A mod is not
# copied file by file; the whole folder is, and Claude loads it from CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_DIRS.

name   Work band
about  Band above the prompt: this branch's PR checks, Jira status and files, with a button that restarts the dev server.

mod    mods/work-band    the mod folder, registered in CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_DIRS

tip  /wb                  toggles the band
tip  click a pane title   opens the PR checks, the files or the server logs beside the transcript
tip  Files                opens the filetree mod's pane when that mod is installed, else the band's own

note  the band's remembered port and other $.store values were left alone
